cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use canonaut in academic work, please cite the SoftwareX article below."
title: "canonaut: A Safe Rust Implementation of the nauty Graph Canonicalization Algorithm"
abstract: >-
  canonaut is a native, memory-safe Rust implementation of the nauty graph
  canonicalization and automorphism-group algorithm, with graph6 I/O,
  vertex-colored canonicalization, digraph support, and Python bindings
  distributed under the same name.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
